{
  "_comment": "Items. stat = round(base_slot_stat * tier_mult * (1 + 0.09*ilvl) * quality * masterwork). One quality roll per item applies to every stat, so items stay sortable and comparable on a phone; per-stat rolls would produce unsortable stat-soup. shop_price = round(1.6 * item_power^1.35 * tier_price_mult), item_power = atk + def + 0.5*spd. sell_price = floor(0.25 * UNDISCOUNTED shop price), so every buy-sell round trip loses at least 75% and arbitrage is impossible even with a maxed shop discount.",
